{
    "title": "Obby Prison Escape from Barry",
    "description": "Jump into epic escape adventure in Obby Prison Escape from Barry! As a prisoner in a high-security facility, your mission is to outsmart Barry the warden, the master of traps and obstacles and attempt a prison break. Experience exciting and challenging obby levels, each designed to test your parkour skills and patience. Face off against four formidable bosses, each one will try to stop you and will challenge your escape plans. Customize your character with three distinct skins to stand out as you make your daring jailbreak. Can you survive Barry's traps and make it to the freedom? Find out in Obby Prison Escape from Barry!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Features:\r\n- exciting and challenging levels\r\n- 4 bosses\r\n- 3 custom made unique skins for your character\r\n- Double jump! You simply won't make it without it\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae How to play:\r\n- Left joystick = move around.\r\n- Swipe on the right side of your device = camera movement.\r\n- Tap JUMP button once to do a single jump and twice to perform a double jump.\r\n- Get closer to special objects and buttons and then tap on \"finger\" button that will appear to activate objects.\r\n- Use \"change view\" button on the top right corner to change view from third person to first person.\r\n- If you find some segment of the level hard to pass, feel free to use SKIP button that appears when you die",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jump into epic escape adventure in Obby Prison Escape from Barry! As a prisoner in a high-security facility, your mission is to outsmart Barry the warden, the master of traps and obstacles and attempt a prison break. Experience exciting and challenging obby levels, each designed to test your parkour skills and patience. Face off against four formidable bosses, each one will try to stop you and will challenge your escape plans. Customize your character with three distinct skins to stand out as you make your daring jailbreak. Can you survive Barry&#39;s traps and make it to the freedom? Find out in Obby Prison Escape from Barry!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Features:<br>- exciting and challenging levels<br>- 4 bosses<br>- 3 custom made unique skins for your character<br>- Double jump! You simply won&#39;t make it without it<br><br>\ud83c\udfae How to play:<br>- Left joystick = move around.<br>- Swipe on the right side of your device = camera movement.<br>- Tap JUMP button once to do a single jump and twice to perform a double jump.<br>- Get closer to special objects and buttons and then tap on &quot;finger&quot; button that will appear to activate objects.<br>- Use &quot;change view&quot; button on the top right corner to change view from third person to first person.<br>- If you find some segment of the level hard to pass, feel free to use SKIP button that appears when you die",
    "summary": "Escape Barry's traps in a thrilling prison break adventure",
